{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I know what you're thinking-&quot;Maybe if I was a beetle, my life wouldn't suck&quot;. Newsflash pal, you're right. How could a beetle playing soccer with dung balls be sad? Anyway, that's why we've invested our life savings into bringing you BeetleBall, the greatest multiplayer dung beetle soccer game to ever exist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Many Unique Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got beetles by the boatload, and each of them have their own wacky abilities that can change the tide of a match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Changing Map Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glide from dandelions to donuts in several different maps. BeetleBall isn't limited by the verticality of a soccer field; climb up a cake, roll a dungball over a log, and maybe even catch a ride on a passing bunny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love beetles and you also love balls, you'll love BeetleBall!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2776270?t=1752644535","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2776270?t=1752644535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776270/08ad4306baa4261e27b32473116e30930b9f6c8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752644535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776270/08ad4306baa4261e27b32473116e30930b9f6c8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752644535","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I know what you're thinking-&quot;Maybe if I was a beetle, my life wouldn't suck&quot;. Newsflash pal, you're right. How could a beetle playing soccer with dung balls be sad? Anyway, that's why we've invested our life savings into bringing you BeetleBall, the greatest multiplayer dung beetle soccer game to ever exist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Many Unique Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got beetles by the boatload, and each of them have their own wacky abilities that can change the tide of a match.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Changing Map Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glide from dandelions to donuts in several different maps. BeetleBall isn't limited by the verticality of a soccer field; climb up a cake, roll a dungball over a log, and maybe even catch a ride on a passing bunny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love beetles and you also love balls, you'll love BeetleBall!</p>","developers":["BugFight Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776270/6d0a62f074af59bb3b312b756ce22a7d2a220cfa/header.jpg?t=1752644535","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148822,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148822/movie480.mp4?t=1748970298","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148822/movie_max.mp4?t=1748970298"},"name":"BeetleBall Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148822/abbeda3aa72ef63c49fbaf0476f12a69d4dccbb7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748